#: www/authors.php:88
msgid "Jay gave me the box on which FreshPorts runs. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"Джей (Jay) предоставил мне машину, на которой работает FreshPorts. Спасибо."

#: www/authors.php:90
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Will Andrews told me about %s. This eventually led to the sanity checks that "
